# Failsafe and fence
#
# Radio and GCS failsafe; geofence. Operating envelope: canopy-ops.md.
#
# --- Failsafe ---
# Throttle/radio failsafe on (3 = enabled, continue mission in Auto/Guided).
FS_THR_ENABLE,3
FS_GCS_ENABLE,1
#
# --- Fence ---
# Fence is off; the limits below are staged, not active.
FENCE_ENABLE,0
FENCE_ACTION,3
FENCE_ALT_MAX,120
FENCE_RADIUS,150
